-- הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד מיום 10.9.2003 (ארגון המורים), חידוש קרן ימי מחלה: the
-- agreement of the State, the Centre of Local Government and the three large
-- cities with ארגון המורים that renews the sick-days fund the special
-- collective agreement of 25.6.1995 set up (outside the corpus), as that
-- agreement's §19 allows once the fund's days are used up, and funds it again
-- with a one-time sum of hours. Whom it covers (§2); the sum (§3); the fund's
-- joint management (§4); what it leaves to the parties (§5); the conditions
-- of a grant to a teacher absent for illness after his accrued sick days ran
-- out (§6), its size (§7), its period (§8), what it does not touch (§9), the
-- salary it is computed on and its deductions (§§10–11), the status of its
-- period (§12); the application, the approvals and the payment (§§13–16); the
-- fund's accounts (§17); exceptions (§18); a further renewal (§19); disputes
-- (§20); and the day it takes effect (§21). Registered on 15.3.2004
-- (7054/2003).
--
-- The Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.3.2018, §21, renews it again, and the
-- agreement of 23.9.2024, §41, funds the fund it set up. The takanon's
-- §1.25.3.1 restates the like fund of the Histadrut's teachers (the
-- agreement of 24.1.1989), which the agreements of 1994 and 1995 sent this
-- one's parties to copy. It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4
-- and is not in oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT sick_pay_law

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיוחד — חידוש קרן ימי מחלה, ארגון המורים (10.9.2003)`

DECLARE `sick-days fund action of 10.9.2003` IS ONE OF
    `allocate the fund's one-time sum of 10.9.2003`
    `pay a grant the fund of 10.9.2003 approved`
    `reimburse the employer for a grant of the fund of 10.9.2003`
    `send the fund's monthly summary of 10.9.2003`
    `report the fund's use every six months, of 10.9.2003`
    `convene the parity committee on a dispute of 10.9.2003`

