-- akn:preamble/p1 The registrar's stamp, partly illegible ([לא קריא]), dated 15-03-2004, and the registration number written by hand (7054/2003); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title, a special collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 The employers: the State, by the wages commissioner and the Ministry of Education's director-general; the Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; and the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 The other side, ארגון המורים, by the chairman of its executive; no rule.
