-- ¶3: signed in Jerusalem on the day written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the sick-days fund renewal of 10.9.2003 was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 10 9 2003

-- ¶12–¶13: the special collective agreement of 25.6.1995 set up the
-- sick-days fund for teaching employees ("the sick-days agreement"); its §19
-- lets it be renewed once all the days left in the fund are used, and after
-- a collective agreement on it. That agreement is outside the corpus.
@ref akn:preamble/p12 akn:preamble/p13
`what the agreement of 10.9.2003 rests on outside the corpus` MEANS
    LIST `outside the corpus` "ההסכם הקיבוצי המיוחד מיום 25.6.1995 לעניין קרן ימי מחלה לעובדי הוראה (הסכם ימי מחלה)",
         `outside the corpus` "תקשי\"ר, פסקאות 33.204 (הגדרת מחלה) ו־33.215 (קידום וותק בחופשת מחלה ללא משכורת)"

GIVEN `the fund's days are all used` IS A BOOLEAN, `a collective agreement renews it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the sick-days agreement of 25.6.1995 may be renewed` `the fund's days are all used` `a collective agreement renews it` IF
    `the fund's days are all used` AND `a collective agreement renews it`

